<title>USA: Olsten Corp acquires VISTECH Inc.</title>
<headline>Olsten Corp acquires VISTECH Inc.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, NY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olsten Corp said Tuesday that its flagship information technology subsidiary, IMI Systems Inc, acquired the stock of VISTECH Inc, a Chantilly, Va.-based consulting and staffing firm with annualized revenues of about $30 million.</p>
<p>In the past 18 months, through acquisitions and internal growth, the company's information technology services business has more than tripled to reach annualized revenues of over $250 million.</p>
</text>
